Missed chance to do something like:<p><pre><code>  class User:
    def calculateCoworkers() = {
      this.coworkers.clear()
      for { d &lt;- this.departments }
        this.coworkers ++ d.employees
    }
</code></pre>
and then, somewhere else...<p><pre><code>  user.calculateCoworkers()
  ... many lines after ...
  for { c &lt;- user.coworkers }
    ... do something ...
</code></pre>
